{"availability":"available","full":"xodn348/han","name":"han","description":"A compiled programming language with Korean keywords, written in Rust","category":"Developer tools","language":"Rust","stars":183,"forks":4,"created":"2026-03-12T14:33:28Z","updated":"2026-07-31T20:44:29Z","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":["compiler","hangul","korean","llvm","programming-language","rust"],"demo":"https://xodn348.github.io/museum-as-code/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T05:14:04.907Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T05:14:04.907Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T05:14:04.907Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T16:22:30.627Z","stars":184,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-04T08:17:45.421Z","stars":184,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-06T16:29:51.649Z","stars":184,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-08T20:07:55.281Z","stars":184,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-11T06:14:04.946Z","stars":183,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-17T05:14:04.907Z","stars":183,"forks":4}],"technologies":["Rust"],"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:39:02.215Z","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A general-purpose compiled language with Korean keywords, types, built-ins, and standard library — written in Rust","Han is a statically-typed, compiled programming language where keywords, type names, 50+ built-in functions, and standard library methods are written in Korean — with all error messages in Korean too. Arithmetic, comparison, and assignment operators follow C/Rust conventions. It compiles to native binaries through LLVM IR and also ships with a tree-walking interpreter for instant execution. The compiler toolchain is written entirely in Rust."],"features":["Korean keywords — 함수, 만약, 이면, 반복, 변수, 상수, 반환, 구조, 시도, 처리, 맞춤","Korean word order — 만약 조건 이면 { }, 조건 동안 { } (SOV) and 동안 조건 { } (SVO)","Korean logical operators — 그리고 (and), 또는 (or)","Hangul identifiers — name your variables, functions, fields in Korean","Compiled & interpreted — hgl build (LLVM IR → clang → binary) or hgl interpret for instant runs"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/xodn348/han/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"1bdff8df61b8bf89ff0a884d1212bd0aa39ce6906c49a203f0e28d559f0b523c","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:15:01.799Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T13:05:03.708Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-07-31T20:44:29Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A general-purpose compiled language with Korean keywords, types, built-ins, and standard library — written in Rust","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/xodn348/han/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"1bdff8df61b8bf89ff0a884d1212bd0aa39ce6906c49a203f0e28d559f0b523c","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/xodn348/han/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T13:05:03.708Z"},"readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/xodn348/han/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T13:05:03.709Z","hash":"1bdff8df61b8bf89ff0a884d1212bd0aa39ce6906c49a203f0e28d559f0b523c","originalBytes":9376,"storedBytes":9376,"truncated":false},"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:21.038Z","latestRelease":{"name":"Han v0.2.0 — 한국어 어순 + 언어 고도화","tag":"v0.2.0","publishedAt":"2026-03-18T19:40:41Z","url":"https://github.com/xodn348/han/releases/tag/v0.2.0"},"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:21.038Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/7159b9e83fef6820c51ba855.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-12T08:15:38.654Z","url":"https://xodn348.github.io/museum-as-code/"}],"qualityPriority":false,"demoHealth":{"url":"https://xodn348.github.io/museum-as-code/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-12T08:15:38.653Z","status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T08:15:38.653Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-12T08:15:38.653Z","target":"https://xodn348.github.io/museum-as-code/","failureCount":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-19T08:15:38.653Z","consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"probeVersion":3},"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T08:15:38.654Z","previewCheck":{"url":"https://xodn348.github.io/museum-as-code/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-12T08:15:38.6